 ## How the kanji combine
 
-焦 has burning or scorching associations, and [点](../kanji/点.md) means point. Digital Daijisen explains the name from black paper scorching where a lens focuses sunlight. This concerns the compound's name, not the historical origin of either individual character. Read ショウ + テン.
